  "description": "Provides transparent encryption for any Sharingan settings provider. Supports multiple encryption strategies including DPAPI (Windows Data Protection API) for machine/user-scoped encryption and AES-256-GCM for cross-platform symmetric encryption. Ideal for storing sensitive settings like API keys, connection strings, and user credentials.",
